  "ALL_TEXT": "93 NT. VEDA'S HOUSE - DAY\nVEDA comes back to his flat. The door is a little open. He\ngets in, gasping for breath and sees SULOCHANA and GOVARDHAN\ntied up to their chairs.\nGOVARDHAN\nVeede, veede .. Indhaaka nenu\ncheppindhi veede\nBABA LEAD HENCHMAN looks at VEDA rather casually.\nBABA LEAD HENCHMAN\nRa .. Kurcho.. rey neelu ivvaraa\nThe ASSISTANT HENCHMAN hands VEDA some water. VEDA drinks the\nwater doubtfully.\nGOVARDHAN\nRowdy gaaru... anni chesindhi veede\nBABA LEAD HENCHMAN\nNuvvena moodovadivi...briefcase\nekkada ra\nVEDA\nEy briefcase\nBABA LEAD HENCHMAN\nChoodu nan tension petaku,...\nbriefcase ekkada\nVEDA\nNannu tension petoddhu, ey\nbriefcase??\nBABA LEAD HENCHMAN\nEe briefcase entra.. Baba daggara\nkottukochindhi\nGOVARDHAN\nveede, veede, indhaaka ne\ncheppindhi veede\nBABA LEAD HENCHMAN\nNuvvu musthaava...briefcase\nVEDA\nEy briefcase\nBABA LEAD HENCHMAN\n(serious)\nila adigithe cheppavu gaani\nBABA LEAD HENCHMAN points a gun at VEDA. BABA SUB-ASSISTANT\nHENCHMAN steps next to BABA ASSISTANT HENCHMAN and whispers\nBABA SUB-ASSISTANT HENCHMAN\nAnna gun trigger stuck undhi\nBABA ASSISTANT HENCHMAN\n(shakes his head)\nManam panikiraani vedhavalu..sarele\nanna chuskuntaadu\nThey step aside\nBABA LEAD HENCHMAN\nippudu cheppu\nVEDA\nCheppu cheppu cheppu antey emani\ncheppanu nuvemanna naa girlfriend\naa?\nSULOCHANA\nNeeku girlfriend undha?\nVEDA\nAbha..\nGOVARDHAN\n(irritated)\nAemi rowdiluvayya meeru...meeru\nvochna pani enti meeru chesthunna\npani enti....aa briefcase gurinchi\nvaadike thelusu vaadini kattesi\nmamalnodhileyandi...\nBABA LEAD HENCHMAN turns back and points the gun at\nGOVARDHAN.\nBABA LEAD HENCHMAN\nDraamaaloddhu, briefcase nee\ndaggare chusaa...cheppu\nGOVARDHAN suddenly starts crying. VEDA and SULOCHANA stare at\nhim.\nBABA LEAD HENCHMAN\nCheppu... chepthaava ledantey\nkalchestha\nGOVARDHAN\nOddhu odddhu... naaku thelidhu\nVEDA\nNaaku telusu\nSULOCHANA is shocked learning this\nGOVARDHAN\nOri...durmaargudaa....intha mosam\nchesthaavaa.. nenu cheppaledhu\nrowdy gaaru\nBABA LEAD HENCHMAN aims the gun at VEDA\nBABA ASSISTANT HENCHMAN\nEkkada\nVEDA\nNaa bed kindha undhi...testha\naagu...\nBABA LEAD HENCHMAN\nNenu emaina vedhavanaa...nenu\nvastha...\nVEDA goes into his room while the LEAD GOON points the gun\nfrom the hall itself. VEDA comes out with a giant suitcase.\nBABA LEAD HENCHMAN\nEntra antha peddha briefcase aa?\nVEDA\nLopala undhi raa dedhdimaag...\nVEDA puts it on the ground and kneels down to open it.\nEveryone is looking at him and the suitcase. He moves to\nchuck the large suitcase at the henchmen, when BABA LEAD\nHENCHMAN pulls the trigger - the gun does not go off. VEDA\nswings the suitcase at the BABA SUB-ASSISTANT HENCHMAN flush\non the head. SULOCHANA kicks the BABA ASSISTANT HENCHMAN in\nhis crotch. VEDA quickly runs over and slugs BABA LEAD\nHENCHMAN to knock him off. The henchmen are tied up in the\nbathroom. VEDA chucks the gun at the SUB-ASSISTANT HENCH and\nlocks them in. THE SUB-ASSISTANT HENCHMAN pulls the trigger,\ndisheartened. It goes off. A beat later, water starts to come\nout off a pipeline.\nCUT TO:",
